msgid "I'm telling you, this necklace doesn't work at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"I see... If you haven't noticed any positive effects, then\r\n"
"it could only mean one thing: you must have been possessed\r\n"
"by an evil spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Wait... That can't be right... How is that even possible...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Since you've already purchased one of our patent-pending\r\n"
"Coral Love Necklaces, I'd be willing to cleanse that spirit\r\n"
"for you... at a special discount rate, of course. Well?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "...Not a chance! I'm never using this stupid necklace again!"
msgstr ""

